{"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"}],"symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"}],"title":"AStarSearchEvent","externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths16AStarSearchEventO","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"AStarSearch.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearch.swift#L18"}},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Weight"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The source is discovered first, at distance zero, with its estimate: the heuristic’s guess at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its distance to the target (zero for the target itself). Then, while a vertex is open, the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the smallest distance plus estimate is examined (closed). When that is the target the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"search ends there. Otherwise each of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offers its target, the examined vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight, and is then relaxed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered vertex is followed by that vertex’s discovery;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one to a closed vertex, which only an inconsistent heuristic allows, by its reopening (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Boost Graph Library’s black target), after which it is examined again. After its last out-edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the examined vertex is finished. When the target is never reached the search ends once no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex is open."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/astarsearchevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What an A* search reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s A* visitor."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"topi